'''Aatrox, Maddox's Brother-In-Law''', is a mayoral candidate that can be elected during the [[Mayor Election]] event. His perks focus around [[Slayer]].

== Mayoral Perks ==
{{MayorPerks|Aatrox}}

== Mechanics ==
'''Pathfinder''' increases the chance of obtaining drops affected by {{stat|mf}} from [[Slayer]] Bosses by {{Green|20%}} ({{Green|1.2x}}). This is done by increasing {{stat|mf}} against Slayer Bosses using the following formula:

<math>\text{NewMagicFind} = (\text{OldMagicFind} \times 1.2) + 20</math>

