== Trivia ==
*In the original [https://hypixel.net/threads/3287083/ patch notes for the 0.9 update], '''Aatrox''' is referred to as {{NPCSprite|Maddox the Slayer}}'s brother-in-law, but his dialogue introduces Aatrox as Maddox's younger brother.
**[[Elle]] refers to Aatrox as Maddox's brother in the Mage branch of the Crimson Isle questline.
*His name is a reference to a ''[[w:League of Legends|League of Legends]]'' [https://wiki.leagueoflegends.com/en-us/Aatrox champion] of the same name.
**Alternatively, it can be directly based on the Latin word atrōx meaning horrible, cruel, terrible or violent.
*'''Aatrox''' was the original name of Maddox before it was changed. This is hinted on the ID name of the [[Maddox Batphone]]: {{Code|AATROX_BATPHONE}}
**In the Mage branch of the Crimson Isle questline, Elle explains that Aatrox has been crafting simple Ability Phones for Maddox's use. This serves as an explanation for the ID having Aatrox's name.
*'''Aatrox'''<nowiki />'s bonus to Slayer XP is multiplicative with the one from [[Century Celebration]].
* On June 3, 2024, when what would become [https://hypixel.net/threads/hypixel-skyblock-patch-notes-0-20-3-better-mayors.5692280/ 0.20.3 — Better Mayors update] first made it on [[Alpha Hypixel Network]], the following has been said: "You didn't hear this from me but apparently '''Aatrox''' and Paul failed to hand in their new campaign plans in enough time. Aatrox claimed he couldn't read Clerk Seraphine's memo (even though she sent out multiple, well in advance), (...)."<ref>https://hypixel.net/threads/hypixel-skyblock-patch-notes-0-20-3-better-mayors.5692280/</ref>
** No news about their 4th perks have been revealed since.
